OL,3,GNEWSAAttorney general reviewing
OL,4,Asentence of boy's killer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe attorney general is reviewing the
OL,7,Fsentencing of a driver who fled to
OL,8,FLatvia after killing a 12-year-old boy
OL,9,Fin the UK.
OL,11,FIt comes after Prime Minister Andy
OL,12,FBurnham told the Commons he would ask
OL,13,Ffor an update in the Aleksanders Dolars
OL,14,Fcase, which he might also raise with
OL,15,Fthe Latvian prime minister.
OL,17,FDolars, 23, was jailed for nine years
OL,18,Fand four months on Friday for causing
OL,19,Fthe death of Keaton Slater by dangerous
OL,20,Fdriving in Coventry in 2024. Dolars
OL,21,Ffled to Latvia after the collision and
OL,22,Fevaded capture for more than two years.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
