OL,3,GNEWSAAttorney general reviewing
OL,4,Asentence of boy's killer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe office of Attorney General (AG)
OL,7,FEllie Reeves said the case, which was
OL,8,Freferred by Coventry North West MP
OL,9,FTaiwo Owatemi, would be reviewed within
OL,10,F28 days.
